# A Shift press and release with nothing typed in between switches between
# Chinese and ASCII; with commit_code, what was typed is committed as is.
# Keys as MacKeyTranslator sends them: the press carries Shift, the release
# carries the state after it.
@engines rime
n
i                   => marked "ni"
Shift+Shift_L
Release+Shift_L     => commit "ni"; marked ""; candidates none; option ascii_mode true
a                   => unhandled
Shift+Shift_R
Release+Shift_R     => option ascii_mode false
n                   => marked "n"; handled
